# Phase 18 user-property/transaction virtual methods and P18-V02 server-free refresh — 2026-10-21T20:00:32Z

Branch: `phase/18-phase-18-compatibility-closure`
Code revision: `27c872bc` (`feat(common): dispatch subtype user property methods`)
Pinned Java source: `efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9`.
Fixture SHA-256: `33de50fa577340aa50df1637f1d2f6aa32ae8d23e5e03ba21a2a012630e37542`.

## Change

- Added subtype hooks for Java `getUserProperty`, `hasProperty`,
  `getTransactionId`, `setTransactionId`, `putUserProperty`, `setTags` and
  `setKeys` methods.
- The Java `setKeys(Collection)` overload is modeled as a dynamic call to the
  String setter overload. `hasProperty` falls back to the stored base map,
  matching Java's direct field lookup rather than virtual `getProperty`.
- The invoked direct-consume fixture compares subtype getter values and write
  counts. It exercises blank and null `putUserProperty` inputs accepted by a
  custom override before base validation.

